Source: https://github.com/microsoft/autogen (42K+ ⭐)
Version: 0.7.5 (autogen-core + autogen-agentchat)
Description: Event-driven Multi-Agent Framework by Microsoft
Extracted:
  - core/: Agent runtime, models, tools, memory, code execution (67 files)
  - agentchat/: Agents, teams, conditions, messages, UI (44 files)
Key Components:
  - RoutedAgent + message_handler — event-driven agent base
  - AssistantAgent, UserProxyAgent, CodeExecutorAgent — agent types
  - RoundRobinGroupChat, SelectorGroupChat, Swarm, MagenticOneGroupChat — team types
  - FunctionTool — tool integration
  - Memory/ListMemory — in-memory store
  - ChatCompletionClient — unified model interface
  - Termination conditions (5 types)
  - CancellationToken — async cancellation
  - SingleThreadedAgentRuntime — agent execution runtime
